<title>USA: FSA qualifies Harris County, Texas, MUD #102.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies Harris County, Texas, MUD #102.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSA said it has qualified for bond insurance a Harris County MUD #102, Texas, $1.475 million water and sewer revenue bond issue scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
